WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.620 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.920 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

02:00.090 --> 02:01.890
A new power...

02:02.720 --> 02:05.180
Demons reappearing...

02:13.320 --> 02:16.400
Fin said there were no more Demons!

02:20.570 --> 02:25.620
It's because Sinbad brought the new Demons...! That's why...!

02:25.620 --> 02:30.040
That's why God gave me this new power.

02:31.920 --> 02:33.420
That has to be it...

02:35.170 --> 02:37.010
That's how it is!

02:38.920 --> 02:41.930
That's why I have to work hard.

02:43.680 --> 02:45.010
Fin...

02:59.740 --> 03:02.070
Hurry back...

03:06.700 --> 03:11.210
Absolutely Gorgeous! A Mysterious Teacher Appears!

03:43.110 --> 03:45.450
I'm late!

04:13.190 --> 04:14.850
This is...

04:14.850 --> 04:20.150
Well then, I'll be having you instruct the first-year students' World History class.

04:20.150 --> 04:21.860
Yes, understood.

04:23.070 --> 04:25.490
"The Angel of Happiness..."

04:26.910 --> 04:29.450
Hey, hey! You kids! Calm down!

04:29.450 --> 04:31.200
Sensei, could you tell us a few things?

04:31.200 --> 04:32.870
What class are you instructing?

04:32.870 --> 04:35.210
How long have you been teaching?

04:35.920 --> 04:38.290
Please, go easy on me.

04:38.290 --> 04:42.090
I just came home from France and this area is unfamiliar to me.

04:42.090 --> 04:44.050
Please ask us anything!

04:48.100 --> 04:50.770
What's the deal? I'm cooler!

04:52.350 --> 04:54.140
I'm disgusted with everyone!

04:54.140 --> 04:57.270
Until yesterday, "Chiaki, Chiaki" was all you heard from them!

04:57.270 --> 04:58.810
So what were you doing here?

04:58.810 --> 05:01.400
Huh? Oh...

05:01.400 --> 05:03.780
The painting...

05:03.780 --> 05:05.820
I was looking at the painting.

05:07.280 --> 05:08.660
Wow!

05:08.660 --> 05:11.330
This is a beautiful painting of an Angel.

05:11.330 --> 05:13.450
I wonder who drew it?

05:13.450 --> 05:15.210
- You don't know?

05:15.210 --> 05:17.370
I believe he is the same age as you...

05:17.370 --> 05:20.590
Yes, I've heard that he is in the same class as you.

05:23.960 --> 05:26.010
It is a wonderful painting.

05:26.010 --> 05:28.930
I understand why it won first place in the art show.

05:28.930 --> 05:33.140
At first glance, it looks like the Angel will move.

05:33.140 --> 05:34.310
I agree!

05:34.310 --> 05:38.400
But if Angels truly existed...

05:39.770 --> 05:42.980
I wonder what they would be like?

05:42.980 --> 05:45.240
If they really existed...

05:47.820 --> 05:50.740
They'd be noisy, ill-mannered...

05:50.740 --> 05:53.660
...and have a sweet tooth.

05:53.660 --> 05:56.410
Snap out of it, Maron! What are you saying?

05:58.790 --> 06:03.000
Maybe Angels are closer than you think, hmm?

06:03.000 --> 06:05.050
Closer?

06:05.050 --> 06:11.390
Have you ever seen the noble, beautiful Angels of William Blake or Perugino?

06:11.390 --> 06:15.020
How did they paint such beautiful Angels?

06:15.020 --> 06:18.560
Angels! Sensei, you believe in Angels?!

06:19.480 --> 06:22.570
The artist of this painting must have felt the same way.

06:23.900 --> 06:27.530
<i>"A painting comes to fruiton because you believe."</i>

06:27.950 --> 06:31.740
The portrait illustrates that saying precisely.

06:34.330 --> 06:36.450
The feeling of faith is so wonderful...

06:45.340 --> 06:50.130
What's so great..about this painting?!

06:52.800 --> 06:56.060
I hate Angels!

07:00.310 --> 07:05.440
If I remember correctly, the artist was in the same class as Jeanne...

07:08.110 --> 07:09.780
This will do.

07:10.530 --> 07:12.530
I choose you!

07:26.960 --> 07:31.010
I'm looking forward to Jeanne's reaction.

07:35.220 --> 07:40.730
In this way, the Hundred Years' War ended in France's vicitory.

07:40.730 --> 07:44.270
Does anyone have any questions so far?

07:44.270 --> 07:48.030
Yes! Me!

07:48.030 --> 07:49.610
Huh? What?

07:49.610 --> 07:51.570
Me! Me!

07:51.570 --> 07:54.280
Sensei... Sensei, are you single?

07:59.620 --> 08:01.290
Hasegawa-kun, it couldn't be...?!

08:07.170 --> 08:09.050
Sensei, do you have a girlfriend?

08:09.050 --> 08:12.010
Could you tell us your favorite type of girl?

08:15.260 --> 08:19.640
Quit it! It's still class time!

08:19.640 --> 08:22.690
Sensei! Hasegawa-kun doesn't look well...

08:22.690 --> 08:25.600
Umm, may I take him to the infirmary?

08:26.810 --> 08:29.270
What's the matter?

08:29.270 --> 08:31.940
May I impose on you to do that, Kusakabe-san?

08:31.940 --> 08:33.280
Yes!

08:34.910 --> 08:37.990
Well, then. Let us continue.

08:44.580 --> 08:47.080
Are you all right, Hasegawa-kun?

08:48.420 --> 08:50.050
Hasegawa-kun?!

08:54.470 --> 08:56.430
My painting is...

09:02.600 --> 09:05.640
So you painted this Angel...

09:05.640 --> 09:07.150
Hasegawa-kun, hang in there!

09:09.320 --> 09:11.070
<i>The Petit Claire!</i>

09:11.070 --> 09:14.030
Hasegawa-kun, are you...?!

09:26.250 --> 09:27.880
How is he?

09:27.880 --> 09:31.210
Uh, yes. He seems to be temporarily anemic.

09:31.210 --> 09:34.470
I see. I'm glad it's nothing serious.

09:34.470 --> 09:36.380
By the way, Kusakabe-san...

09:36.380 --> 09:38.680
Yes, what is it?

09:38.680 --> 09:42.430
Actually, I have something for you.

09:44.770 --> 09:46.810
From your father...

10:06.410 --> 10:08.000
Father...

10:08.000 --> 10:09.580
<i>Maron...</i>

10:09.580 --> 10:12.130
<i>I'm worried about whether you're doing well or not.</i>

10:12.130 --> 10:17.510
<i>I won't be back for a while, but look out for your health and be a good girl. - Dad</i>

10:17.510 --> 10:19.340
Father...

10:19.340 --> 10:26.270
When I met your father in France, I told him I was going to this school...

10:28.270 --> 10:31.940
...and he asked me to keep that for you.

10:31.940 --> 10:34.940
- Your father spoke of how sorry he was...

10:33.400 --> 10:34.940
- Sensei

10:37.240 --> 10:38.900
What are you trying to do?

10:42.950 --> 10:46.870
Chiaki. What are you saying? I'm...

10:46.870 --> 10:49.330
Nagoya Chiaki-kun...was it?

10:55.460 --> 10:58.920
T-That bastard! H-Hold on!

11:01.390 --> 11:05.060
You idiot! Sensei isn't like you!

11:31.170 --> 11:34.960
<i>I'm worried about whether you're doing well or not.</i>

11:34.960 --> 11:40.470
<i>I won't be back for a while, but look out for your health and be a good girl. - Dad</i>

11:49.020 --> 11:53.770
Hey, Sinbad! Let's tell Jeanne the truth and straighten things out!

11:53.770 --> 11:55.230
That wouldn't work.

11:55.230 --> 11:57.110
Never mind that, what about the Demons?

11:57.110 --> 12:00.280
Something's going on and we don't know what.

12:00.280 --> 12:01.570
But!

12:01.570 --> 12:04.320
Even if we told her, she wouldn't believe us after all this time.

12:04.320 --> 12:08.200
Anyway, if Fin comes back now...

12:09.330 --> 12:10.830
Maron is...

12:14.040 --> 12:18.210
For now, I'm just going to focus on protecting Maron.

12:18.210 --> 12:21.010
Geez, what am I going to do with you?!

12:22.050 --> 12:24.050
Sorry, Access.

12:25.300 --> 12:28.010
I'll keep watch over Jeanne.

12:51.580 --> 12:52.580
Huh?

12:56.120 --> 12:58.210
The painting... The painting is gone!

12:58.210 --> 13:01.000
I think it is in the art room.

13:01.000 --> 13:04.970
Something about the necessity of altering the painting.

13:04.970 --> 13:08.890
Hasegawa-kun seemed to be in some sort of rush.

13:09.260 --> 13:11.430
The Angel of Happiness

13:13.230 --> 13:15.230
Alter this painting?

13:16.980 --> 13:18.310
Is he going to...?!

13:18.310 --> 13:21.150
Uhh Sensei, thank you very much!

13:27.490 --> 13:29.700
Art Room

13:33.410 --> 13:34.870
<i>A Demon is really...</i>

13:36.290 --> 13:38.710
Hasegawa-kun? Ha--

13:54.430 --> 13:57.060
Why? Why are you altering the painting?

14:02.110 --> 14:03.480
This is...!

14:06.110 --> 14:08.360
Is there really a Demon in this painting?!

14:10.530 --> 14:12.450
Don't interfere!

14:21.130 --> 14:22.040
Don't...

14:36.600 --> 14:39.140
Oh, man! I've got to tell him!

14:51.780 --> 14:53.870
This is going to be fun!

15:00.960 --> 15:05.420
<i>"Tonight at 8:00 P.M., I will be taking the beauty of the "Angel of Happiness" painting."</i>

15:05.420 --> 15:07.380
<i>- Kaitou Jeanne</i>

15:07.380 --> 15:08.920
It's been a while.

15:17.640 --> 15:19.730
<i>Fin, lend me your power!</i>

15:19.730 --> 15:22.560
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

15:44.040 --> 15:46.250
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

15:46.250 --> 15:48.380
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

15:48.380 --> 15:50.420
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

15:56.970 --> 16:00.890
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

16:12.240 --> 16:13.530
Let's go!

16:15.120 --> 16:19.240
Okay, guys! Don't let your guard down just because it's been a while!

16:19.240 --> 16:24.290
Listen up! We're going to make Jeanne pay for showing up again!

16:24.370 --> 16:26.340
Huh? Why?

16:28.170 --> 16:30.630
Is everyone in position?

16:33.630 --> 16:35.430
J-Jeanne!

16:36.720 --> 16:38.850
It's Jeanne!

16:38.850 --> 16:39.680
Cool!

16:39.680 --> 16:41.060
It's a new costume!

16:41.060 --> 16:43.060
- It looks good on her.

16:41.810 --> 16:43.060
- No kidding.

16:43.060 --> 16:44.770
Looks like I messed up!

16:56.660 --> 16:57.620
You're good...

16:59.410 --> 17:00.120
But...

17:04.250 --> 17:05.960
I'm not letting you escape!

17:09.670 --> 17:10.460
Got you!

17:13.170 --> 17:15.380
Give up, Jeanne!

17:16.760 --> 17:19.890
I was following Jeanne...

17:21.180 --> 17:22.640
That Jeanne...!

17:27.190 --> 17:28.230
Jeanne's here!

17:28.230 --> 17:30.230
Hurry! She's at the inner yard!

17:37.450 --> 17:41.160
Just now...the painting was completed.

17:41.160 --> 17:45.290
The painting has just been completed.

17:46.420 --> 17:47.750
Hasegawa-kun.

17:47.750 --> 17:52.050
I call it: "An Angel Burning in the Flames of Hell."

18:00.390 --> 18:02.890
<i>The Angel is suffering...</i>

18:07.600 --> 18:08.980
Stop it!

18:08.980 --> 18:11.150
STOP IT!!!

18:21.370 --> 18:22.330
The Demon!

18:26.200 --> 18:27.580
I won't let you!

18:36.260 --> 18:37.170
<i>Die!</i>

18:43.260 --> 18:44.430
Jeanne!

18:46.020 --> 18:48.310
Are you all right, Jeanne?

18:49.440 --> 18:51.100
Sinbad...

18:52.440 --> 18:55.400
Stop it! What are you planning now?!

18:55.400 --> 18:58.990
You idiot! Quit it! This is no time to be arguing!

19:00.530 --> 19:02.910
<i>Both of you, die!</i>

19:02.910 --> 19:07.450
What are you going to do? I can't hold on much longer!

19:08.080 --> 19:11.080
Why? Why do you protect me?

19:11.080 --> 19:14.290
Because I decided to protect you forever.

19:20.470 --> 19:21.930
Hasegawa-kun!

19:27.930 --> 19:29.600
My painting...

19:37.440 --> 19:40.490
My... My Angel's painting...

19:43.660 --> 19:45.740
My Angel's...

20:00.590 --> 20:01.930
Hasegawa-kun!

20:01.930 --> 20:03.930
Jeanne, now!

20:04.640 --> 20:11.100
<i>Why? I've robbed this heart of all of its beauty...!</i>

20:14.100 --> 20:15.940
Did you really believe...

20:15.940 --> 20:21.700
...that you could erase someone's beautiful heart with a painting drawn by a fake heart?!

20:21.700 --> 20:22.950
<i>Impossible!</i>

20:30.000 --> 20:31.660
In the name of God...

20:33.790 --> 20:36.170
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:38.750 --> 20:41.630
I seal you here!

20:51.560 --> 20:53.230
<i>Checkmate!</i>

21:00.030 --> 21:02.190
<i>Collection completed!</i>

21:10.120 --> 21:14.500
They exist! Angels really exist!

21:14.500 --> 21:16.120
Hasegawa-kun!

21:16.120 --> 21:16.790
Jeanne!

21:18.210 --> 21:21.960
Jeanne, no matter how much I'm misunderstood...

21:21.960 --> 21:24.590
You're an enemy, Sinbad!

21:24.590 --> 21:26.640
Hurry! To the art room!

21:31.930 --> 21:35.100
Tonight, I take another deceptive beauty.

21:37.230 --> 21:39.310
Hasegawa-kun!

21:40.730 --> 21:43.440
Geez, how pathetic.

21:45.650 --> 21:50.410
Hmph! How boring...

22:17.020 --> 22:18.310
<i>He saw me!</i>

22:28.700 --> 22:35.330
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.040 --> 22:44.750
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.300 --> 22:49.220
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.220 --> 22:52.890
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.100 --> 23:02.020
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.610 --> 23:05.780
Never forgetting...

23:06.070 --> 23:09.910
...there is unending love.

23:10.610 --> 23:14.660
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.830 --> 23:17.950
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.200 --> 23:21.170
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.630 --> 23:26.090
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.300 --> 23:30.180
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.380 --> 23:37.970
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:48.150 --> 23:50.950
My true identity...has been found out.

23:51.780 --> 23:53.320
Ahh, what do I do?!

23:53.320 --> 23:57.580
Shikaido-sensei saw me transform! I can't go to school anymore!

23:57.580 --> 24:01.250
And what is Miyako going to say about me being Jeanne?!

24:01.250 --> 24:04.580
<i>Maron... You've been lying to me all this time...</i>

24:04.580 --> 24:07.590
Ohh, it's all over...

24:07.590 --> 24:11.590
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: An Indomitable Spirit Blazing to Cheer Up

24:11.970 --> 24:14.220
Fin...I won't lose!
